'''Ivan's Wampa House''' was the name of several restaurants in the [[central marketplace]] of [[Ro Station]], a [[city]] on [[Pantora]]. According to the [[Aurebesh]] signage that was put up to to attract customers, the restaurant served "delicious [[steak]]s", "authentic Pantoran [[Kebab|kebobbery]]", and "[[fusion]]" cuisine.<ref name="Cornered" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
At one point in ''[[Star Wars: The Bad Batch]]'' episode "[[Cornered]]," it is possible to see three separate signs in the central marketplace, all labeled "Ivan's Wampa House" above their respective entrances. Additional signage can be seen on the building that houses one of the restaurants, near the entrance; this is best seen when [[Hunter]] rides off on his stolen [[speeder bike]]. One sign says "DELICIOUS STEAKS", another says "AUTHENTIC PANTORAN KEBOBBERY", while the third one is partially obscured; it says "<small>''[obscured]''S FUSION ''[obscured]''</small>.<ref name="Cornered" />

